			],
			"Message": "chore(Land): Advance submodules — Remove deprecated transport layers and RPC scaffolding\n\n**Common** (refactor): Delete the deprecated `Effect` module and all transport implementation modules (gRPC, IPC, WASM, Registry, Metrics, Retry, CircuitBreaker) along with their DTO components. Keep only core modules (Environment, Error) and the Common transport interface.\n\n**Mountain** (refactor): Eliminate unused module declarations including legacy `Hover`, `DefaultConfigurations`, `NLSResolver`, the `Enhanced` subdirectory, and 11 dormant RPC scaffolding modules (Types, EchoAction, Commands, Workspace, Configuration, Windows, Terminals, Debug, SCM, Processes, Telemetry). Condense `Source/RPC/mod.rs` documentation to describe only the active `CocoonService` surface.\n\nThis cleanup removes dead code following the architectural migration to new IPC and telemetry patterns, reducing noise in the module tree and ensuring only actively-used paths remain in scope.",
			"SHA": "ddf572e383d0d4668786e21be607862852ffaffa"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-05-28T16:29:29Z",
			"File": [
				"⠁⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				27,
				1
			],
			"Message": "chore(Land): Advance Mountain submodule — Normalize import separations in Vine and Git handlers\n\nUpdate Mountain submodule to commit 54102e9d, which completes the absolute-path migration by finalizing import statement cleanup in `Source/Vine/Server/Initialize.rs` and `Source/Vine/Server/MountainVinegRPCService.rs`. Apply the established two-line import pattern to separate `::Vine::Error` and `::Vine::Generated` type imports from local `crate::` bindings.\n\nAlso normalize Git service handlers in `Source/IPC/WindServiceHandlers/Git/` by using single-line consolidated imports for local modules in `HandleRevListCount` and `HandleRevParse`, and expand multi-line `uuid::Uuid::new_v4()` calls to block style in `HandleExec` and `HandleRevParse` for improved readability.\n\nThis finalizes the import normalization across all gRPC service handlers, ensuring consistent separation between canonical library imports and local project bindings.",
			"SHA": "39f31afac27182ffb496644f510f29af94186102"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-05-28T16:12:39Z",
