				1
			],
			"Message": "chore(Land): Advance Air submodule — Collapse multi-line use declarations\n\nUpdate Air submodule to commit 1e06bf0c, which normalizes import formatting across all 15 AirServiceProvider method modules by flattening multi-line `use` statements into single-line declarations.\n\nThis aligns with the recent style pass that collapsed function signatures and documentation comments, reducing vertical noise while preserving all functionality. Affected modules include Authenticate, ApplyUpdate, CheckForUpdates, DownloadFile, DownloadStream, DownloadUpdate, GetConfiguration, GetFileInfo, GetMetrics, GetResourceUsage, GetStatus, IndexFiles, SearchFiles, SetResourceLimits, and UpdateConfiguration.",
